WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:04,980
You, you are still protecting her, right?

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,780
She is our Yoyo King

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:10,090
Still our sister

4
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,930
We don't protect her

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:12,930
Who are you protecting?

6
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:15,700
Jiaojiao is also your sister

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,750
But she wasn't born from her aunt's belly

8
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:23,400
Could it be that he was born from my uncle’s belly?

9
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:29,690
You naughty missiles

10
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,110
bad sister

11
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,870
I think you are tired

12
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,550
Uncle Chan, call someone over

13
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:35,910
I'm going to beat them both up

14
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:40,860
do as i tell you

15
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,510
Not allowed to go

16
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:51,170
Look at them carefully

17
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:52,810
I share the same golden and iron bones

18
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:55,170
What's the point of fearing a small defeat?

19
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,810
Mom, haven't you eaten?

20
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:58,730
Have some energy

21
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:00,810
That's all you have, right?

22
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,800
Husband is suspended from work

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,980
Let's mix and beat

24
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,290
My eldest uncle is now a coach

25
00:01:11,290 --> 00:01:14,420
Before retiring, he had won the national boxing championship

26
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:22,820
I know I'm scared this time

27
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:25,740
Good baby Good baby

28
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:33,260
Third brother won't let uncle hit you

29
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:35,580
Cousin Nada, can you please be gentle?

30
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:42,060
I didn't expect this time

31
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,140
You still plead for us

32
00:01:44,140 --> 00:01:45,740
Living on the rain for half my life

33
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:47,740
I just regret that I have never met democracy

34
00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:49,100
If the king does not give up

35
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:51,220
I would like to worship you as my adoptive father

36
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:56,770
Oops

37
00:01:56,770 --> 00:01:58,090
No need to wear boxing gloves

38
00:01:58,090 --> 00:01:59,530
You two, please be honest with me.

39
00:01:59,530 --> 00:02:01,410
I'll take care of you when your eldest uncle comes back.
